# Kconfig entry point for the esp-pqc component. It owns no options of its own:
# each group is defined next to the code that reads it and pulled in here, so
# everything still appears under one menu.
#
#   components/liboqs/Kconfig     - CONFIG_LIBOQS_*, consumed by CMakeLists.txt
#                                   and components/liboqs/cmake/*.cmake.
#   components/mbedtls/Kconfig.pqc - the esp-pqc CONFIG_MBEDTLS_*, consumed by
#                                   components/mbedtls/CMakeLists.txt (which
#                                   mbedTLS tree to build) and by the root
#                                   CMakeLists.txt (the hybrid TLS features it
#                                   injects onto the mbedTLS targets).
#
# The default ESP-IDF mbedTLS options are NOT reached from here.
# components/mbedtls/Kconfig re-exposes those, and ESP-IDF reads that file
# directly as the override component's Kconfig.

menu "Post-Quantum Cryptography (esp-pqc)"

    rsource "components/liboqs/Kconfig"

    rsource "components/mbedtls/Kconfig.pqc"

endmenu
